flowchart TD
    A[Intent / Mission] --> B[Spec + Acceptance Criteria]
    B --> C[Repository Comprehension]
    C --> D[Ponytail Ladder]
    D --> E[Loop-Graph Plan]
    E --> F{Parallelizable?}
    F -->|Yes| G1[Worker A / Worktree A]
    F -->|Yes| G2[Worker B / Worktree B]
    F -->|No| G3[Single Worker / Worktree]
    G1 --> H[Deterministic Verification]
    G2 --> H
    G3 --> H
    H --> I{Pass?}
    I -->|No| J[Diagnose + Targeted Retry]
    J --> H
    I -->|Yes| K[Fresh Gauntlet Critic]
    K --> L{Pass?}
    L -->|No| M[Ranked Critic Failures]
    M --> J
    L -->|Yes| N[Fan-in Integration]
    N --> O[Integration Verification]
    O --> P[PR / CI / Staging]
    P --> Q[Live E2E]
    Q --> R[Evidence Episode]
    R --> S[Hermes Learning Review]
    S --> T[Skill / Memory Candidate]
